* RF Front Section ngspice Netlist
* Based on structural.drawio Section 1: SЧ-тракт и секция отсечения
* PIN_Switches, Mixer_1, Mixer_2, TV_Tuner, KT368A buffer, Diode clamp

VPIN_SW 1 0 DC 0
VMIXER1 2 0 AC 1
VMIXER2 3 0 AC 1
VTV_TUNER 4 0 AC 1

* Dummy components
RPIN_SW 1 0 50
RMIXER1 2 0 50
RMIXER2 3 0 50
RTV_TUNER 4 0 50

* Frequency sweep notes:
* .AC DEC 10 100k 10Meg
* .PRINT AC V(1) V(2) V(3) V(4)

.END
